$comment sample_cell record: 10 pins, every 1 ms (0.001 MHz), 4000 samples = 4000 ms, 100 before the trigger (at the start of step 1); first sample at 9e+08 ns from RUN $end
$timescale 1ns $end
$scope module fpga $end
$var wire 1 ! clk $end
